WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.579
You've built the pieces.

2
00:00:01.579 --> 00:00:03.448
Now let's put them to work.

3
00:00:03.448 --> 00:00:04.563
Your plan doesn't have to

4
00:00:04.563 --> 00:00:06.861
look exactly like anyone else's.

5
00:00:06.861 --> 00:00:10.577
Your experience, your network, your financial situation,

6
00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:12.423
and the kind of work you're pursuing

7
00:00:12.423 --> 00:00:14.733
will affect what you prioritize.

8
00:00:14.733 --> 00:00:17.729
What matters is that you know your next move.

9
00:00:17.729 --> 00:00:19.865
Look over the plan you created.

10
00:00:19.865 --> 00:00:22.408
Choose the actions you're going to take first, and

11
00:00:22.408 --> 00:00:25.380
make your commitment for the next 24 hours.

12
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.354
Momentum doesn't start tomorrow.

13
00:00:27.354 --> 00:00:29.328
It starts with the next action you take.

14
00:00:29.328 --> 00:00:31.301
Your 48 hours start now.
